      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "This overview uses passive chain-head and aggregate queue observations. **Idle / unexercised means no current queued or in-flight work, not verified cross-chain health. Unknown means unavailable or unconfigured.** When enabled, the protocol dashboards show separately retained canonical outcomes, costs, finality and request history. No continuous active canary is configured by this view."
